    "text": "By James Davis ,\n18 hours ago A calm walk along the beautiful River Palisades in Kentucky was all the woman had in mind. She anticipated nothing more than crisp air and tranquil scenery. As she continued, something unusual drew her gaze. A tiny movement on the cliffside, paired with faint cries, made her freeze where she stood. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
